<rml>
<head>
	<title>UI test</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/oz.rcss"/>
	<style>
		/* the native UI's test page: every render path P4 brings, over a picture from the player's game */
		body {
			decorator: image( /levelshots/q3dm17 cover );
		}
		/* crisp stripes, so the glass panels' backdrop blur shows */
		.shade {
			position: absolute;
			left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
			decorator: repeating-linear-gradient( 45deg, #05040460 0dp, #05040460 14dp, #db241030 14dp, #db241030 16dp );
		}
		.panel {
			position: absolute;
			left: 90dp;
			top: 110dp;
			width: 760dp;
			padding: 28dp 34dp;
			background-color: #0a080790;
		}
		.panel p {
			margin: 6dp 0 18dp 0;
			color: #c9bfb5;
		}
		.line {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: space-between;
			height: 46dp;
		}
		.line .value {
			width: 90dp;
			text-align: right;
			color: #ffad33;
		}
		.items {
			margin: 14dp 0;
		}
		.items div {
			padding: 4dp 0 4dp 14dp;
			border-left: 2dp #db2410;
			margin-bottom: 4dp;
		}
		.buttons {
			display: flex;
			margin-top: 16dp;
		}
		.buttons button {
			margin: 0 12dp 0 0;
		}
		/* the effects column */
		.cards {
			position: absolute;
			left: 930dp;
			top: 110dp;
			width: 440dp;
		}
		.card {
			height: 104dp;
			margin-bottom: 30dp;
			padding: 16dp 18dp;
			border-radius: 10dp;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #fff3e6;
		}
		.gradient {
			decorator: linear-gradient( 135deg, #db2410 0%, #ffad33 100% );
			filter: drop-shadow( #ff4a1cb0 0 14dp 18dp );
		}
		.clipped {
			overflow: hidden;
			border-radius: 50dp 10dp;
			transform: rotate(-4deg);
		}
		.clipped .picture {
			position: absolute;
			left: -40dp; top: -40dp; right: -40dp; bottom: -40dp;
			decorator: image( /levelshots/q3dm6 cover );
		}
		.clipped .band {
			position: absolute;
			left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
			height: 38dp;
			padding: 8dp 18dp;
			background-color: #000000b0;
		}
		.glow {
			background-color: #1a1513;
			border: 1dp #5a4f49;
			box-shadow: #ff4a1cd0 0dp 0dp 22dp 14dp;
		}
		.filtered {
			decorator: image( /levelshots/q3dm7 cover );
			filter: grayscale( 1 ) opacity( 0.75 ) blur( 2dp );
		}
		.spin {
			display: block;
			width: 80dp;
			height: 80dp;
			margin: 0 auto;
			decorator: conic-gradient( #db2410, #ffad33, #fff3e6, #db2410 );
			border-radius: 40dp;
		}
		/* endless animations only on a shown page: a hidden one's would keep RmlUi updating it */
		body.shown .spin { animation: 6s linear infinite turn; }
		@keyframes turn {
			from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
			to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body data-model="test">
	<div class="shade"/>
	<div class="panel glass">
		<h1>Oz Arena native UI</h1>
		<p>RmlUi on the engine's renderer: a test of every path. Arrows, the d-pad or the mouse move the focus.</p>

		<div class="line"><span>Level</span><input type="range" id="level" min="0" max="100" step="5" data-value="level" autofocus/><span class="value">{{level}}</span></div>
		<div class="line"><span>Enabled</span><input type="checkbox" id="enabled" data-checked="enabled"/><span class="value">{{enabled ? 'yes' : 'no'}}</span></div>
		<div class="line"><span>Name</span><input type="text" id="name" maxlength="24" data-value="name"/><span class="value">{{name}}</span></div>

		<div class="items">
			<div data-for="item, i : items">{{i + 1}}. {{item}}</div>
		</div>

		<div class="buttons">
			<button id="press" data-event-click="press">Pressed {{clicks}} times</button>
			<button id="second">Second</button>
			<button id="third">Third</button>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="cards">
		<div class="card gradient">Gradient, drop shadow</div>
		<div class="card clipped"><div class="picture"/><div class="band">Rounded clip mask, turned</div></div>
		<div class="card glow">Box shadow</div>
		<div class="card filtered">Grayscale, opacity, blur</div>
		<div class="spin"/>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
